# Keeps ~/.agents/skills tracked even when it has no committed skills.
# Skills committed under dot_agents/skills/ in the chezmoi repo are the shared
# defaults deployed to every machine. Skills dropped directly into
# ~/.agents/skills on a machine are left untouched by chezmoi (this directory is
# NOT `exact_`), so local-only skills never become part of the repo unless you
# explicitly `chezmoi add` them.
